<title>FRANCE: Axime to bid for Sligos.</title>
<headline>Axime to bid for Sligos.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Computer services group Axime will make a friendly bid on the shares and convertible bonds of Sligos as part of the companies merger plans, the two firms said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>The offer is either six Axime shares for five Sligos shares, or two Axime shares and 1,750 francs for five Sligos shares.</p>
<p>The two companies announced their alliance plans on Monday.</p>
<p>Bank Paribas has a 26.1 percent stake in Axime.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
